6:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:tracking-tight prose-p:leading-8 prose-a:text-blue-700","children":[["$","section","What free PDF tools should be judged on",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What free PDF tools should be judged on"}],[["$","p","PDF tools should preserve document order, page quality, file integrity, and privacy. A merge tool is not successful if it changes page orientation, strips important metadata unexpectedly, or forces sensitive documents through an unknown upload path.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"PDF tools should preserve document order, page quality, file integrity, and privacy. A merge tool is not successful if it changes page orientation, strips important metadata unexpectedly, or forces sensitive documents through an unknown upload path."}]]}],["$","p","The right tool depends on the job. Merging invoices is different from editing legal clauses. Extracting a page is different from building a signed workflow. Free tools are strongest when the task is narrow and the desired output is easy to verify.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"The right tool depends on the job. Merging invoices is different from editing legal clauses. Extracting a page is different from building a signed workflow. Free tools are strongest when the task is narrow and the desired output is easy to verify."}]]}]]]}],["$","section","When ToolOrbit is a good fit",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"When ToolOrbit is a good fit"}],[["$","p","ToolOrbit is a good fit for quick operations: merge PDFs, split pages, convert PDF pages to images, and package images into a PDF. It is also useful when PDF work sits beside image compression, cropping, conversion, and Base64 utilities.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"ToolOrbit is a good fit for quick operations: merge PDFs, split pages, convert PDF pages to images, and package images into a PDF. It is also useful when PDF work sits beside image compression, cropping, conversion, and Base64 utilities."}]]}],["$","p","The workflow is intentionally focused. It is not a full contract editing platform or approval system. That constraint is useful when you simply need the file operation done quickly.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"The workflow is intentionally focused. It is not a full contract editing platform or approval system. That constraint is useful when you simply need the file operation done quickly."}]]}]]]}],["$","section","When a full PDF suite is better",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"When a full PDF suite is better"}],[["$","p","Use a full PDF suite when you need redaction, digital signatures, form preparation, comments, permissions, OCR, or enterprise compliance features. Those are not small utility tasks and should not be treated casually.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Use a full PDF suite when you need redaction, digital signatures, form preparation, comments, permissions, OCR, or enterprise compliance features. Those are not small utility tasks and should not be treated casually."}]]}],["$","p","Use developer libraries when PDF generation is part of an application. For example, invoices, reports, and statements often need repeatable templates, test coverage, and server-side generation.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Use developer libraries when PDF generation is part of an application. For example, invoices, reports, and statements often need repeatable templates, test coverage, and server-side generation."}]]}]]]}],"$Le"]}]
